WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:05.629
Minds were blown, jaws were dropped, marbles
were lost, and social media sites were nearly

00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:11.260
broken after Marvel announced its Phase 4
slate at San Diego Comic-Con 2019.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:16.000
Here's what delighted fans on Twitter had
to say about each upcoming Phase 4 project.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:21.679
Directed by Cate Shortland and featuring Scarlett
Johansson's iconic superhero, the Black Widow

00:00:21.679 --> 00:00:24.659
solo movie announcement had fans pumped.

00:00:24.659 --> 00:00:28.890
Marvelites are thrilled Black Widow is finally
getting a standalone film, which will begin

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:32.820
the MCU's Phase 4 when it hits theaters on
May 1, 2020.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:33.820
One fan wrote,

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:38.430
"We are less than a year away from a Black
Widow solo film I am honestly SHOOK to my

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.430
CORE.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:41.760
Natasha deserved her own movie from the get-go."

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:45.200
A fellow Black Widow fan felt much the same,
tweeting,

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.940
"Crying but happy crying to hear officially
#BlackWidow finally getting her own standalone

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.600
movie Scarlett Johansson girl bring it in
this solo movie.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.920
I could care less what others say this is
truly amazing.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:01.960
I can't wait to see this Marvel movie in theaters
May 1, 2020 #girlpower."

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:06.960
Directed by Chloé Zhao and centered on a
race of cosmic immortal beings, The Eternals

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.420
features a diverse all-star cast.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:14.650
The star-studded roster sent fans into a tailspin
— as did its confirmed release date of November

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:15.650
6, 2020.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:17.030
One fan tweeted,

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:21.420
"Damn the cast of Eternals is straight up
FIRE, it's perfect.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:24.450
Angelina Jolie, Richard Madden and Kumail
Nanjiani?

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:25.450
The excellence.

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:29.570
We are about to enter a whole new era of superheroes."

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:30.570
Another added,

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:33.350
"It is a mildly emotional moment to see this
cast.

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:37.500
The representation of people of color and
women in this film in front and behind the

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.920
camera is crazy.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.120
I can't wait to see this!!!"

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:45.760
Director Destin Daniel Cretton's Shang-Chi
and the Legend of the Ten Rings, based on

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:49.990
Marvel's Master of Kung-Fu, garnered a similar
response from fans.

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:55.340
Chinese-Canadian actor Simu Liu will be the
MCU's Shang-Chi, a role he actually reached

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:57.540
out to Marvel about playing via Twitter.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:02.340
The film, due out in theaters on February
12, 2021, will feature a predominantly Asian

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:05.520
cast alongside Liu's martial arts master.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.550
One user wrote in response to the news,

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:10.640
"MARVEL NOW HAS A FILM WITH ALL ASIAN ACTORS
IN IT.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.520
COME ON, ASIAN REPRESENTATION!"

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:16.740
A Twitter user by the name of William Yu was
especially moved by the Shang-Chi reveal,

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:17.740
writing,

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:21.940
"As a kid, I couldn't have even imagined a
superhero movie with Asian leads.

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.090
I can't believe it's really happening.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:25.310
The movement is real.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:27.260
It's not stopping.

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:28.960
Representation matters today."

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:34.320
Marvel fans went mad over the news that Benedict
Cumberbatch's Dr. Stephen Strange is finally

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:39.310
getting a sequel with the Scott Derrick-directed
Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness,

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:41.780
coming our way on May 7, 2021.

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:46.350
Of particular note amongst Marvelites were
three things: the film's title that suggests

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:50.930
the existence of the multiverse in the MCU;
the announcement that Elizabeth Olsen's Scarlet

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:55.410
Witch will play a part in the story; and Derrickson's
promise that the Doctor Strange sequel would

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.569
be a legitimate horror movie.

00:02:57.569 --> 00:02:58.569
One fan wrote:

00:02:58.569 --> 00:03:00.770
"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness.

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:02.530
Logo: 9/10.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:03.600
HYPE AF.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.670
HORROR.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.680
ELIZABETH OLSEN + DOCTOR STRANGE?

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.680
This looks incredible.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.870
Give me more of that crazy mystic dimension
s---.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:15.069
Doctor Strange is lowkey one of my favorites
and I'm super looking forward to this one."

00:03:15.069 --> 00:03:16.260
Another fan tweeted,

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:19.849
"Pretty much everything Marvel announced today
is super intriguing.

00:03:19.849 --> 00:03:23.770
They're clearly headed in a much more comic-booky
direction and I'm hyped.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.849
This one excites me most of all.

00:03:25.849 --> 00:03:30.030
Doctor Strange magic &amp; Wanda's magic and the
multiverse? of MADNESS?

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.960
What more could I ask for."

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:37.519
The fifth Phase 4 film announced at San Diego
Comic-Con also has a totally campy title:

00:03:37.519 --> 00:03:39.090
Thor: Love and Thunder.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:43.260
But don't be fooled by the name — the fourth
Thor flick, written and directed by Ragnarok

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:48.350
helmer Taika Waititi, will pack a serious
punch with the introduction of Natalie Portman's

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:53.960
Jane Foster as the female Thor, plus the confirmation
that Tessa Thompson's New Asgard ruler Valkyrie

00:03:53.960 --> 00:04:00.670
is bisexual, making her the first openly LGBTQ+
superhero in the MCU.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:04.019
Understandably, fans freaked out over the
reveal of Thor: Love and Thunder, scheduled

00:04:04.019 --> 00:04:06.510
to hit theaters on November 5, 2021.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:10.769
"I'll listen to you 'til this is empty."

00:04:10.769 --> 00:04:11.769
One wrote,

00:04:11.769 --> 00:04:16.549
"Natalie portman is back as FEMALE THOR. tessa
thompson said valkyrie wants a girlfriend

00:04:16.549 --> 00:04:21.989
bc as the new king of asgard she needs her
queen … THOR 4 IS GONNA BE AWESOME AND LOVELY."

00:04:21.989 --> 00:04:25.521
Elsewhere in the Twitter-sphere, another fan
said that they're most keen on Thor: Love

00:04:25.521 --> 00:04:28.410
and Thunder out of all the Phase 4 movies
announced.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.040
"Thor: Love and Thunder excites me the most.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:36.120
Taika Waititi is director AND WRITER, allowing
him to take it in his own insane way.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:41.271
The brilliant tone/structure created in Ragnarok
now combined with the return of Natalie Portman

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.720
as female Thor sounds like a match made in
heaven."

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.480
As for the five Marvel superhero shows coming
to the Disney+ streaming site, people had

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.250
a whole lot of feelings.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:55.310
Tweeting about The Falcon and the Winter Soldier,
featuring Anthony Mackie and Sebastian Stan

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.000
reprising their MCU roles, one fan wrote,

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:03.160
"The idea of this is interesting and I can't
wait to see what the story will revolve around."

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:08.560
Many were hyped about WandaVision, the sure-to-be-strange
limited series starring Elizabeth Olsen as

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:14.151
Wanda Maximoff, a.k.a. Scarlet Witch, Paul
Bettany as Vision, and Teyonah Parris as Monica

00:05:14.151 --> 00:05:15.160
Rambeau.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:19.160
One fan tweeted their guess at what the show,
which Marvel Studios President Kevin Feige

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:24.080
said is weird and wacky and "unlike anything"
Marvel has done before, might be like:

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:29.030
"I feel like wandavision is going to be kind
of a mix between house of m and the 2015 vision

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:31.210
comic and it's going to be great.

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:35.880
also i dont know what monica rambeau would
do in a show like this but i am SO EXCITED."

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:40.800
Tom Hiddleston's Loki series got fans in a
tizzy as well, with many tweeting that they're

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:45.449
so happy the actor is getting to reprise his
role as an Avengers-era Loki getting mixed

00:05:45.449 --> 00:05:47.520
up in all sorts of adventures.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:50.280
One fan even addressed Hiddleston directly,
writing,

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:54.360
"I'm so happy for you and I'm really excited
about loki tv series.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.880
Its gonna be good to see you again."

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.810
While another extremely excited fan tweeted,

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:02.100
"TOM HIDDLESTON AS LOKI AND FINALLY GETTING
HIS OWN SERIES.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:05.550
WOW TRULY THE MOST POWERFUL THING IVE EVER
HEARD OF AND WILL WITNESS.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.289
PLEASE ITS GOING TO BE SO AMAZING…

00:06:07.289 --> 00:06:09.400
IM SO EXCITED YOU DONT EVEN KNOW"

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.960
"Loki!

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:12.110
Loki!

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:13.240
Loki!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.080
Loki!"

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:19.400
Starring Jeremy Renner as the sharpshooting
hero, the Hawkeye series has fans excited

00:06:19.419 --> 00:06:24.259
for its inclusion of Kate Bishop, Clint Barton's
successor whom he'll train on the show.

00:06:24.259 --> 00:06:27.699
Marvel hasn't yet announced which actress
will play Kate and take on the Hawkeye mantle

00:06:27.699 --> 00:06:30.449
when Clint steps down, but that hardly matters.

00:06:30.449 --> 00:06:32.110
Fans are already buzzing.

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.110
One fan tweeted,

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:34.950
"OH S--- A HAWKEYE SERIES!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:35.950
This is amazing!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.169
I'm very hyped for MCU Hawkeye.

00:06:38.169 --> 00:06:42.759
He's so underutilized in the movies (except
Endgame) and I really wanted Marvel to explore

00:06:42.759 --> 00:06:44.130
[a] good character more.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:46.640
Now it's finally his time to shine!"

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:51.920
Marvel also unveiled the first-ever animated
series in the MCU: What If…?, premiering

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.550
on Disney+ in the summer of 2021.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:58.889
The show, narrated by Jeffrey Wright as the
"non-earthly being" the Watcher and featuring

00:06:58.889 --> 00:07:04.569
the voices of several MCU favorites, will
add a twist to the 23-movie Infinity Saga.

00:07:04.569 --> 00:07:05.569
One fan tweeted,

00:07:05.569 --> 00:07:08.669
"Can't wait to see marvel studios' first venture
into animation.

00:07:08.669 --> 00:07:10.699
I have high expectations.

00:07:10.699 --> 00:07:12.800
Can't wait to get Uatu The Watcher.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:17.100
Glad this is being treated as an important
part of the slate just like everything else.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.940
Love what if scenarios!"

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.880
Writer Eric Vespe was incredibly intrigued
by the reveal of What If…?, tweeting,

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.490
"This is one of my most anticipated projects
on the Marvel slate.

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:28.289
I grew up obsessed with these books.

00:07:28.289 --> 00:07:32.639
A lot of times I liked the What If stories
better than the actual real ones.

00:07:32.639 --> 00:07:35.259
Can't wait to see what direction the animation
is going.

00:07:35.259 --> 00:07:38.210
Cartoony like Clone Wars or hyper real?"

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:42.850
Strap in for Phase 4 of the Marvel Cinematic
Universe starting with Black Widow on May

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:47.460
1, 2020, and be sure to keep your arms and
legs inside the moving vehicle until it comes

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:51.139
to a stop with Thor: Love and Thunder on November
5, 2021.

00:07:51.139 --> 00:07:53.800
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:57.349
Plus, even more Looper videos about the MCU
are coming soon.

00:07:57.349 --> 00:08:00.940
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

